1
00:00:00,147 --> 00:00:02,057
(Mike:)Well, you're having one with me.

2
00:00:07,321 --> 00:00:08,321
(Sheldon:)All right.

3
00:00:10,591 --> 00:00:12,261
(Mike:)To your dad.

4
00:00:15,997 --> 00:00:19,467
(Howard:)I never had a beer
with my dad, either.

5
00:00:23,104 --> 00:00:25,174
(Sheldon:)Do you mind?
We're having a moment here.

6
00:00:33,581 --> 00:00:35,691
(Amy:)I can't believe Penny's
married to Zack.

7
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,350
I wonder what she saw in that guy.

8
00:00:37,518 --> 00:00:38,858
(Howard:)I don't know.

9
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:40,860
(Bernadette:)He's sweet, he's tall, handsome.

10
00:00:41,022 --> 00:00:42,592
(Amy:)Broad shoulders, good hair.

11
00:00:42,690 --> 00:00:44,640
(Raj:)Hmm, wonder what she
sees in Leonard.

12
00:00:48,629 --> 00:00:49,939
(Bernadette:)How's it going out there?

13
00:00:50,097 --> 00:00:53,477
(Howard:)Sheldon and your dad are bonding
and completely ignoring me.

